From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:29:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: quiesce and release Direct Switch resources

Coordinate Direct Switch startup, shutdown and quarantine before
releasing shared DMA rings, buffers and group resources.

Split from:
  package/kernel/mac80211/patches/ath12k/906-ath12k-native-ppe-direct-switch.patch - wifi: ath12k: implement native PPE Direct Switch DMA and buffer ownership

Merged from:
  906-01-wifi-ath12k-add-native-PPE-direct-switch.patch
  906-02-wifi-ath12k-fix-IPQ5332-REO-register-offsets.patch
  906-03-wifi-ath12k-batch-native-Direct-Switch-RX-recycling.patch
  906-04-wifi-ath12k-amortize-native-Direct-Switch-TX-polls.patch
  906-05-wifi-ath12k-notify-PPE-on-DS-buffer-returns.patch
  906-06-wifi-ath12k-auto-enable-supported-native-Direct-Switch.patch
  906-07-wifi-ath12k-use-revision-specific-DS-registers.patch
  907-01-wifi-ath12k-coordinate-mixed-bus-group-shutdown.patch
  907-02-wifi-ath12k-protect-recovery-tables-and-link-cleanup.patch
  907-03-wifi-ath12k-repair-legacy-HW1-Direct-Switch-metadata.patch
  907-04-wifi-ath12k-separate-DS-control-and-DMA-stop-errors.patch
  907-05-wifi-ath12k-bound-and-index-legacy-DS-source-repair.patch

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/msm-modules/wlan-fw-api/+/9ab723333db68e4552672f9e2a5cc6f8e4027894/hw/qcn9224/
